# Sentinel AI Frontend - Environment Configuration
# Set VITE_API_BASE to your deployed production FastAPI backend URL (e.g. https://api.sentinel-ai.com or https://your-backend.onrender.com)
# When deploying to Vercel, configure VITE_API_BASE in your Vercel Project Settings -> Environment Variables.
# In local development, the app automatically connects to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
VITE_API_BASE=
